  "limits": [
    "Pool Panic Endless adds escalating ten-formation pool flags using four original single-use conveyor plants. Accepted packets, actors and used mowers carry; each flag opens a48-packet delivery quota and only missing empty support pads return. Native flag display, high-water best records, automatic boundary saves and the existing browser persistence queue replace finite completion awards. Earlier minigames, accepted artwork, original mode IDs, unlock rules and serialized object layouts are preserved. Full original parity remains unverified.",
    "Focused production-method tests and build checks do not replace broad game or browser validation.",
    "Earlier results remain historical parent evidence only. No separately image-generated challenge illustrations are active."
  ]
